{"task_id": "aml:GN21-T1", "dataset": "applied-modeling-lib", "project_id": "GN21-T1", "root": "GN21DriverSurgePricing.PaperInterface.theorem1_single_state_threshold_best_response", "label": "aligned", "reason": "沿用既有case明确限定的正收益、有限可积单状态域，将informal定位到Appendix C.2的非退化分支，而非声称覆盖整个Theorem1。C.2原文独立明确先假设F({τ:w(τ)>0})>0，并将其余零收益情况分开说为trivial；所以正收益限制有原文支撑。有限概率μ、非负可测w且支付与τ可积时，正质量正支付集合等价于formal总支付>0。λ>0对应Poisson率；thresholdRatePolicy逐正τ定义τ∈σ iff c≤wτ/τ，方向和非严格边界与原文一致；singleStateMeasurableOptimal量化全部可行可测策略；renewal reward精确为λ∫σw/(1+λ∫στ)。未用作者注释替代独立原文。若另将target改成完整Theorem1，则本root漏掉w≡0分支：例如μ为[1,2]均匀分布、λ=1、w=0满足原模型且c=0的accept-all最优，但root正总支付假设不成立。这是覆盖差，不是当前已冻结非退化target的负例。", "human_adjudicated": false, "gold_label": null, "reference_ready": false, "review_status": "historical_model_review_packaged_input_not_reassessed", "input_sha256": "4d6755735c17fad6a79a90a18169fb589089a748f194c96b3ba941907728e6f3", "reviewed_graph_sha256": "7b735ebd2bd196852b1ccbbd621e1f58f286b84b81e060fb432accadfa16d906", "review_scope": "Archived compiled/extracted Formal and frozen source pairing; packaging adds no new semantic judgment.", "source_review_url": "https://github.com/MechMath/PaperLeanBench/blob/964f2d92e71b1b911e568790a7196a6fb7e1250b/experiments/real-project-errors/screen-08/batch-01/alignment-review-01/prpkg-gn.json", "review_report": "metadata/evidence/analysis/applied-modeling-lib/GN21-T1.json", "review_report_sha256": "012d88126b9289cb1cdbfa76aeb72f27779ecbba76813b44de78446bc270b52f"}
