{"task_id": "aml:GHW-theorem9_1_bid_independent_lower_bound", "dataset": "applied-modeling-lib", "project_id": "GHW-theorem9_1_bid_independent_lower_bound", "root": "GHW01DigitalGoods.PaperInterface.theorem9_1_bid_independent_lower_bound", "label": "aligned", "reason": "The full frozen Theorem 9.1 is recovered by an explicit fixed-dummy reduction within the root's universally quantified bid-independent rules. The old lowCount=0 concern does not lose attained min=1: apply the root to the rule that first adds a fixed bid 1, then restore that bidder. This gives actual min=1, max=H, F≥αH and R/F≤2/H. Natural H≥2 supplies an unbounded bad-input family, as required by the source's asymptotic existence claim.", "human_adjudicated": false, "gold_label": null, "reference_ready": false, "review_status": "model_pre_qwen_semantic_recheck", "input_sha256": "20dc5274f3f9dfd7dc49c66597b34edce10d90e35cab61352b7b8fe83c527114", "reviewed_graph_sha256": "4e97f7317d71e9d214fbb1c8c2a28806172d5a90b8a07a192b8ff88ee6152802", "review_scope": "按用户于 2026-11-05 确认的完整论文命题口径审查；不以条件性证明步骤替代完整命题。", "source_review_url": "https://github.com/MechMath/PaperLeanBench/blob/964f2d92e71b1b911e568790a7196a6fb7e1250b/experiments/real-project-errors/screen-08/batch-01/alignment-review-01/new-families.json", "review_date": "2026-11-09", "review_report": "metadata/evidence/analysis/applied-modeling-lib/GHW-theorem9_1_bid_independent_lower_bound.json", "adjudication_decision": "withdraw_provisional_misaligned_pending_equivalence_review", "previous_input_sha256": "c92c79b649e5620a2674986484a8d466ff2686023dda2abf3ae5e68dbf16d776", "previous_label": "undetermined", "reviewer": "Codex with parallel source/semantic review", "reviewer_type": "model", "strict_review_date": "2026-11-05", "strict_review_previous_label": "misaligned", "strict_review_method": "Statement/definition comparison; counter-explanations checked; no proof certification.", "review_report_sha256": "2e9c479554ee865b01e43e58cc798eb41c4adc2004c647a116f