{"task_id": "aml:GHW-theorem9_3_deterministic_truthful_lower_bound", "dataset": "applied-modeling-lib", "project_id": "GHW-theorem9_3_deterministic_truthful_lower_bound", "root": "GHW01DigitalGoods.PaperInterface.theorem9_3_deterministic_truthful_lower_bound", "label": "aligned", "reason": "按完整论文的上下文模型判 aligned：原稿 §2 以报价集合为输入，§5.1 用同一个报价值集合到价格的函数，Lemma 9.2 将结果联系到此模型；结合原作者在后续论文中明确将早期下界归于 symmetric auctions，采用匿名报价集合模型的解释。formal 的共同 focusedOutcome 显式表示这一模型，不能仅因有匿名字段就判其新增源外限制。自然数 H 给出无界坏例族；对添加固定报价 1 的派生机制应用 formal，再回到原机制，得到实际 min=1、max=H、F≥αH 及 R/F≤2/H，补齐 lowCount 可为 0 的规范化问题。此为有明确源模型解释的暂定语义对齐，不声称覆盖允许身份定价的任意非匿名机制，也不是 Lean 机器认证的跨模型等价证明。", "human_adjudicated": false, "gold_label": null, "reference_ready": false, "review_status": "model_rechecked_aligned_under_contextual_source_model", "input_sha256": "77784b836363410511239ee5a0d78f5a52be578e6fec682c46382ad047742a98", "reviewed_graph_sha256": "6dff5f374a46c36d74f239d828d19ef87ce4ff985954d8132c5d0b946670bebc", "review_scope": "完整论文 Theorem 9.3，结合 §2、§5.1 与 Lemma 9.2 确定源模型；保持当前 frozen informal 和 formal 原文不变。", "source_review_url": "https://github.com/MechMath/PaperLeanBench/blob/964f2d92e71b1b911e568790a7196a6fb7e1250b/experiments/real-project-errors/screen-08/batch-01/alignment-review-01/new-families.json", "review_date": "2026-11-09", "review_report": "metadata/evidence/analysis/applied-modeling-lib/GHW-theorem9_3_deterministic_truthful_lower_bound.json", "adjudication_decision": "confirm_provisional_aligned_under_contextual_source_model", "previous_input_sha256": "8b1e165ae61936509212eac938e5335e0c602a69ec0fc878e68a794fa396b9d2", "previous_label": "undetermined", "reviewer": "Codex", "reviewer_type": "model", "strict_review_date": "2026-11-09", "strict_review_previous_label": "undetermined", "strict_review_method": "Full-paper contextual source-model adjudication with author corroboration and mathematical normalization bridge; not Lean-certified.", "review_report_sha256": "b37f897f0e92ad0bbd7d53f5f300532f3dfdaca0d9f7ec606